// Project `platform-wake`: no project variables on purpose (ADR-IR34 decision 17).
// A Deploy a Release step can pass variables that override the child's variables (V1). The one step therefore
// reads only PlatformWake.OctopusApiKey (library variable set Platform Automation, octopus/terraform) and system
// variables, and no app process passes a PlatformWake.* variable (offline test CAP-OCT-014).
